            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I presume replacement is done with `sr{]`. In this case it is an expected behavior, because [opening brackets include outer whitespace padding into them](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/964fab7fecd14f66a69a96162f8aa816480690fd/doc/mini-surround.txt#L29-L30). Try using `sr}]` to not include whitespace.\r\n\r\nHere are [more examples of this behavior](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/964fab7fecd14f66a69a96162f8aa816480690fd/doc/mini-surround.txt#L166-L176).",
